{"id":63,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"青陵の学びで地域に貢献する力を育成","feature_description":"佐賀県立武雄青陵中学校は、県立中高一貫教育校として、6年間を見通した学びを行う学校です。地域や社会に目を向けながら、基礎学力、探究心、協働する力を育てます。公立校としての教育活動を通じて、生徒が自ら目標を立て、将来の進路や社会への関わりを考える力を段階的に伸ばします。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":1263,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/takeoseiryouchuugakkou/?content=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95%E7%B4%B9%E4%BB%8B","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1264,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/takeoseiryouchuugakkou/?content=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95%E7%B4%B9%E4%BB%8B","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1265,"name":"硬式テニス部（男女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/takeoseiryouchuugakkou/?content=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95%E7%B4%B9%E4%BB%8B","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1266,"name":"バレーボール部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/takeoseiryouchuugakkou/?content=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95%E7%B4%B9%E4%BB%8B","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1267,"name":"バスケットボール部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/takeoseiryouchuugakkou/?content=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95%E7%B4%B9%E4%BB%8B","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1268,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/takeoseiryouchuugakkou/?content=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95%E7%B4%B9%E4%BB%8B","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1269,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/takeoseiryouchuugakkou/?content=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95%E7%B4%B9%E4%BB%8B","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1270,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/takeoseiryouchuugakkou/?content=%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95%E7%B4%B9%E4%BB%8B","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1271,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.education.saga.jp/hp/takeos